ex:ALT_P04 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "차세대반도체소재부품(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P04 .
ex:ALT_P05 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "합성생물학기반구축(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P05 .
ex:ALT_P06 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "디지털치료기기개발(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P06 .
ex:ALT_P07 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "첨단바이오제조혁신(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P07 .
ex:ALT_P08 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "공공AI서비스고도화(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P08 .
ex:ALT_P09 a mcdm:Alternative ; rdfs:label "차세대통신핵심기술(대안)"@ko ; mcdm:representsEntity ex:P09 .

